           "shortComment": "Davis returned one kickoff for 31 yards during Thursday's 41-31 win versus the Lions.",
           "longComment": "Davis logged just eight offensive snaps in Week 2 despite Ty Johnson (hamstring) being inactive, and he did not record any carries or receptions. It appears unlikely he'll have much fantasy utility in the near future unless starter James Cook misses time."
