           "shortComment": "Campbell made six tackles (two solo) in the Lions' 41-31 loss to the Bills on Thursday night.",
           "longComment": "Campbell played all 74 defensive snaps for the Lions, displaying intense physical conditioning against a Bills offense that was constantly on the field. The starting middle linebacker posted a similar stat line during Week 1 in a long game against the Saints, showing consistent availability and production for the team's defense."
