           "shortComment": "Banks (toe) has been ruled out for the remainder of Sunday's game against the Jets.",
           "longComment": "The starting left guard exited Sunday's contest in the second quarter after sustaining a toe injury. Banks will not return, leaving Jager Burton to slot in at guard due to Donovan Jennings' (hand) injury."
