           "date": "2026-09-20T21:21Z",
           "shortComment": "Bako-Bewele (knee) likely suffered a long-term injury in Sunday's 20-17 overtime win over the Jets, Rob Demovsky of ESPN.com reports.",
           "longComment": "Bako-Bewele was carted off the field with a knee injury during the first quarter of Sunday's game. The starting right tackle appears set to miss extended time, although further information should be made available in coming days."
