           "shortComment": "Gray (concussion) does not have an injury designation ahead of Sunday's game against the Eagles.",
           "longComment": "Gray logged three straight practices as a full participant in Week 2. The starting weakside linebacker has been cleared by an independent neurologist to play in Sunday's contest and is all set to suit up opposite James Williams (elbow) or Owen Pappoe on the strong side."
