           "shortComment": "Carmona suffered a shoulder injury during Sunday's 24-20 loss to the Eagles, Terry McCormick of TitanInsider.com reports.",
           "longComment": "Carmona operated as the team's starting right guard in the contest, but he will leave Week 2 a little worse for wear. The exact nature of the injury is currently unclear, but Carmona's status at the team's first practice of the week Wednesday will shed some light on his condition."
