           "shortComment": "Helm caught both of his targets for 13 yards in the Titans' 24-20 loss to the Eagles on Sunday.",
           "longComment": "Through two games, Helm has six grabs for 40 scoreless yards on seven targets. He's unlikely to be a productive fantasy option in a Tennessee passing offense that has been anemic so far this season."
