           "shortComment": "Beal (hamstring) is questionable to return to Sunday's contest against the 49ers.",
           "longComment": "Beal is dealing with a hamstring injury, and as a result, he may not be able to return to the team's Week 2 battle with San Francisco. In his absence, Malik Herring and Clelin Ferrell will stand to see an increase in workload on the defensive line."
