           "shortComment": "Homer reverted to the Steelers' practice squad Monday, per the NFL's transaction log.",
           "longComment": "Homer is set to be elevated again for the Steelers' Week 3 matchup against the Bengals due to the injury to Rico Dowdle (toe). Homer had two carries for 16 yards, coupled with 10 special-teams snaps in Sunday's loss to the Patriots. The running back should serve as the No. 3 running back behind Jaylen Warren and Eli Heidenreich if Dowdle cannot suit up for next Sunday's contest."
