           "shortComment": "Woodaz (thumb) was a full participant at practice Wednesday.",
           "longComment": "Woodaz broke his thumb during the Texans' preseason game at Las Vegas in August, but it doesn't look like that will keep him out in Week 1 versus the Bills. The rookie fourth-rounder projects to start his career in a rotational role at linebacker."
