           "date": "2026-09-22T00:59Z",
           "shortComment": "St-Juste (hamstring) was a full participant in Monday's estimated practice, Tom Silverstein of the Milwaukee Journal Sentinel reports.",
           "longComment": "St-Juste was unable to suit up for the Packers' 20-17 win over the Jets on Sunday. The cornerback suffered a hamstring injury during Friday's practice but appears to have recovered enough to start practicing in full in anticipation of Thursday's game against the Falcons."
