           "date": "2026-09-17T00:38Z",
           "shortComment": "The Chiefs placed McDonald (knee) on injured reserve Wednesday.",
           "longComment": "McDonald will now be forced to miss at least four games after sustaining a knee injury during Monday's win over the Broncos. Ashton Gillotte, R Mason Thomas and Jack Pyburn should be in line for increased playing time in McDonald's absence."
