           "last_seen_at": "2026-09-23T02:32:38.541Z",
           "fp": "Active|2026-09-16T23:10Z|Milroe will be more involved in practice ahead of Sunday's game versus Arizona, Curtis Crabtree of Fox 13 Seattle reports.",
           "status": "Active",
           "date": "2026-09-16T23:10Z",
           "shortComment": "Milroe will be more involved in practice ahead of Sunday's game versus Arizona, Curtis Crabtree of Fox 13 Seattle reports.",
           "longComment": "Sam Darnold (glute) won't suit up in Week 2, meaning Drew Lock will be the team's starting signal-caller. Milroe will occupy the No. 2 spot on the depth chart, so head coach Mike Macdonald wants to be sure he is ready to go in case Lock gets injured."
