           "longComment": "Folk missed a 53-yard field goal in the fourth quarter of Sunday's contest. The kicker's 41-yard attempt near the end of the first half was the Falcons' only points on the afternoon. Folk is now 3-for-6  on field-goal attempts and has made his sole PAT over the first two weeks of the season."
