           "shortComment": "Mukuba (knee) is active for Sunday's game against the Titans.",
           "longComment": "Mukuba did not participate in Thursday's practice with a left knee injury. The free safety quickly upgraded to limited participation Friday in anticipation of Sunday's contest. Mukuba is now all set to suit up as a starter in the Eagles' secondary next to strong safety Marcus Epps."
