           "date": "2026-09-10T23:20Z",
           "shortComment": "Ogletree (neck) was a full participant in practice Thursday.",
           "longComment": "The tight end was limited by a neck injury a day earlier. Ogletree is trending toward playing in Sunday's opener against Baltimore. The 2022 sixth-round pick has added depth to the Colts' tight-end spot throughout his career, seeing action on special teams as well."
