           "shortComment": "Masses recorded five tackles (four solo) and two interceptions in Sunday's 26-14 win over the Chargers.",
           "longComment": "Masses picked off Justin Herbert in the first and fourth quarters, helping the Raiders secure an upset over a division rival. The fifth-round rookie put together a stellar performance while playing 73 percent of the defensive snaps in Sunday's contest, likely securing himself the starting cornerback role in Darien Porter's (foot) absence."
