           "date": "2026-09-22T00:27Z",
           "shortComment": "Coach Kevin O'Connell said Monday that Ingram-Dawkins is \"day-to-day\" after injuring his hip in Week 2 at Chicago, Alec Lewis of The Athletic reports.",
           "longComment": "Ingram-Dawkins left in the first quarter of the Vikings' victory in Week 2 after suffering a hip injury, but it seems like he avoided anything too severe. His status will be worth keeping an eye on when Minnesota releases its first official injury report of the week Wednesday."
