           "shortComment": "Kittle caught all four of his targets for 80 yards and a touchdown in Sunday's 35-13 win over the Dolphins.",
           "longComment": "Kittle gained half of his yardage on a 40-yard catch to start the second half, and he scored a 12-yard touchdown three plays later. He had just 12 receiving yards in the Week 1 win over the Rams, as Kittle returned from an Achilles tear sustained in January. Kittle will try to build on Sunday's strong performance in Week 3 against the Cardinals."
