           "shortComment": "Hooper caught two of his four targets for 20 yards in Sunday's 34-3 loss to the Panthers.",
           "longComment": "Hooper's target tally was fairly robust considering his role as the No. 3 tight end. The 31-year-old saw the second-most targets for the Falcons on Sunday, finishing behind only wide receiver Drake London. For as long as either Cooper Rush or Jack Strand is at the helm of the offense, Hooper's large catch radius and experience could keep netting him consistent attention and production."
