           "shortComment": "Demercado had three carries for eight yards in Sunday's 37-20 win over the Commanders.",
           "longComment": "Demercado logged just nine offensive snaps in the contest, playing second fiddle to Javonte Williams throughout the day. The running back is primarily a reserve option, with Williams set to be the bell cow as long as he's healthy."
