           "longComment": "Flott was limited in all three practices due to a quadriceps injury that prevented him from playing in the Titans' 24-20 loss to the Eagles in Week 2. If he's unable to play Sunday, then Micah Robinson would likely start at outside cornerback for a second consecutive game opposite Alontae Taylor."
