           "shortComment": "The Vikings elevated Van Noy from the practice squad to the active roster Saturday ahead of Sunday's game against the Bears.",
           "longComment": "Van Noy started in the Vikings' Week 1 win over the Packers, playing 25 defensive snaps and 37 percent of the team's plays. The veteran logged only one solo tackle in the effort but provided enough experience and stability to likely see reps once again in Week 2 against a fearsome Bears rushing attack."
