           "shortComment": "Ingram-Dawkins (oblique) was a full participant in Thursday's practice.",
           "longComment": "Ingram-Dawkins was limited Wednesday to begin the practice week, though after being upgraded Thursday, it seems as if he will be good to go Sunday versus Tampa Bay. The 23-year-old finished his rookie campaign in 2025 with 12 total tackles (six solo), including 1.0 sacks, and one pass defended."
