           "status": "Active",
           "date": "2026-09-26T17:42Z",
           "shortComment": "The Packers signed Tomlinson off the Cowboys' practice squad Saturday, Ian Rapoport of NFL Network reports.",
           "longComment": "Tomlinson spent the offseason with the Cowboys' practice squad after being waived by the Texans in December. The offensive guard will now add depth to an injury-stricken Packers offensive line."
