           "shortComment": "Bourne caught two of his three targets for 11 yards in Sunday's 31-7 loss to the Seahawks.",
           "longComment": "Bourne played 30 of the Cardinals' 50 offensive snaps in Sunday's contest. The wide receiver continues to garner some attention behind leading weapons Trey McBride and Michael Wilson while playing a significant share of the team's snaps."
