           "shortComment": "Madubuike (neck) was a full participant in Wednesday's practice.",
           "longComment": "Madubuike has not practiced in full since suffering a significant neck injury in September of 2025. If he's able to participate in full throughout Week 3 prep, the defensive tackle could be cleared to make his season debut against the Cowboys in Rio on Sunday."
