           "shortComment": "Juszczyk recorded two catches on two targets for 27 yards and a touchdown in Sunday's win over the Dolphins.",
           "longComment": "Juszczyk mad&#281; the start and played just over 50 percent of the offensive snaps. The 35-year-old veteran is in his 14th NFL season but doesn't carry much, if any, fantasy value in redraft formats as a lead blocker."
