           "shortComment": "Hill rushed twice for six yards and caught two targets for 12 yards in Sunday's 24-17 loss to the Saints.",
           "longComment": "Hill was on the field for 27 of the Ravens' 58 offensive snaps. The running back saw usage as both runner and receiver, providing a fast contrast to Derrick Henry's bulk. It appears Hill may be on track for more consistent complementary opportunities than last season behind Derrick Henry in Baltimore's new offense."
