           "shortComment": "Slye missed his only field-goal attempt and made a PAT during Sunday's 12-7 loss to the Giants.",
           "longComment": "Slye missed his first kick of the young season, pushing a 59-yard field-goal try wide left late in the second quarter. The contest took place in the midst of a nor'easter, making the playing conditions rather treacherous, so his long miss doesn't come as a surprise. The kicker now has gone 3-for-4 on field-goal attempts while making all four of his extra-point tries through three games this season."
