           "date": "2026-09-30T04:37Z",
           "shortComment": "Warner recorded 17 tackles (eight solo) in Sunday's win over Arizona.",
           "longComment": "The Cardinals ran a whopping 87 offensive plays Sunday, and Warner was on the field for all of them, leading to the inflated tackles number. The 17 tackles were the most Warner has ever recorded in a single game during his nine-year career. Through three games this season, Warner has 33 tackles (14 solo), including 0.5 sacks, two forced fumbles and one pass breakup."
