           "shortComment": "The Texans signed Ogunbowale off the Raiders' practice squad Tuesday.",
           "longComment": "Ogunbowale signed with the Raiders' practice squad after being trimmed from the team's roster during final cuts. The running back now returns to Houston, where he participated in 129 offensive snaps and 281 special-teams snaps over 17 regular-season games in 2025."
